# I03.var03 prospective contract design — matched partial P-CREW OUT

Status: **design only**. No I03.var03 package, input, run, native result, or acceptance exists. Root owns selection, Git, catalog, SSH/native execution and publication. This memo is a proposal for an independently reviewed contract, not a GO or a simulation result.

